<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <%- include ("../partials/header.ejs") %>
</head>

<body>

  <%- include ("../partials/nav.ejs") %>

<div class="jumbotron text-center">
  <div class="container">
    <a href="/" class="lang-logo">
      <img src="https://admin.atlis.ai/logo-transparent.png">
    </a>
    <h1>Stratis AI Agent Chat</h1>
    <p>This is a sample application deployed to Heroku. It shows how a simple chat interface for a Stratis AI agent can be deployed to an existing website.</p>
    <a type="button" target="_blank" class="btn btn-lg btn-primary" href="https://admin.atlis.ai/setup/?step=ChatBubble">
      View Configuration in Stratis AI 
      <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-new-window"></span>
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="container">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h3><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-info-sign"></span> Notes for Your Developers</h3>
      <table class="table table-bordered">
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th>Stratis Org ID</th>
            <td><%= STRATISAI_ORG_ID %></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th>Stratis Chat Client ID</th>
            <td><%= STRATISAI_CHAT_CLIENT_ID %></td>
          </tr>
          <!-- <tr>
            <th>This Heroku App</th>
            <td>
              <a href="https://dashboard.heroku.com/apps/your-app-name" class="btn btn-primary">View</a>
            </td>
          </tr> -->
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-6">
      <h3><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span> Next Steps</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Try some sample converstaions with the agent(s).</li>
        <li>Continue building out this site!</li>
        <li>Optionally, you can also insert the chat bubble code into your existing site. Copy the code from the <a target="_blank" href="https://admin.atlis.ai/setup/?step=ChatBubble">chat deployments configuration Setup</a> page.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-link"></span> Helpful Links</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><a target="_blank" href="https://admin.atlis.ai">Stratis AI Admin Site</a></li>
        <li><a target="_blank" href="https://elements.heroku.com/addons/stratisai">Stratis AI Addon Page</a></li>
        <li><a target="_blank" href="https://devcenter.heroku.com/articles/stratisai">Stratis AI Addon Docs</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div> <!-- row -->
  <div>

  </div>
</div>

<%- SCRIPT_STRATISAI_CHAT_BUBBLE_CONFIG %>

</body>
</html>
